        "description": "## Purpose\nCreates multiple Petstore users in a single call by sending an **array of user objects**.\n\n## Endpoint\n- **Method:** `POST`\n- **URL:** `{{petstoreBaseUrl}}/v2/user/createWithList`\n\n## Prerequisites / Variables\nThis request relies on the following variable:\n- `{{petstoreBaseUrl}}` (environment/collection/global)\n\nExample value:\n- `https://petstore.swagger.io`\n\n## Request body\n### Schema (high-level)\n- **Type:** `array`\n- **Items:** `object` (User)\n\nEach **User** object typically includes:\n- `id` (integer)\n- `username` (string)\n- `firstName` (string)\n- `lastName` (string)\n- `email` (string)\n- `password` (string)\n- `phone` (string)\n- `userStatus` (integer)\n\n### Example payload\n```json\n[\n  {\n    \"id\": 555,\n    \"username\": \"yuvi_postman\",\n    \"firstName\": \"Yuvaraj\",\n    \"lastName\": \"Santhanakrishnan\",\n    \"email\": \"yuvi@gmail.com\",\n    \"password\": \"Phoneix@01\",\n    \"phone\": \"Phoneix@01\",\n    \"userStatus\": 1\n  },\n  {\n    \"id\": 666,\n    \"username\": \"John_postman\",\n    \"firstName\": \"John\",\n    \"lastName\": \"David\",\n    \"email\": \"John@gmail.com\",\n    \"password\": \"Olympi@01\",\n    \"phone\": \"Olympi@01\",\n    \"userStatus\": 0\n  }\n]\n```\n\n## Pre-request script behavior\nBefore the request is sent, the pre-request script reads the raw JSON body, parses it, and sets these **environment variables** (based on the first two array items):\n- `user1_id`\n- `user2_id`\n- `user1_username`\n- `user2_username`\n\nThese are useful for chaining into later requests (for example, \"Get User by Username\").\n\n## Expected responses\n### 200 OK (Success)\nSample response body:\n```json\n{\n  \"code\": 200,\n  \"type\": \"unknown\",\n  \"message\": \"ok\"\n}\n```\n\n### 500 Server Error (Example)\nA 500 example is saved for documentation/troubleshooting purposes (see saved examples under this request).\n\n## Using this request in collection runs\n- Ensure an environment is selected (e.g., **AI DEMO**) that defines `petstoreBaseUrl`.\n- Run this request before any dependent user operations.\n- The pre-request script will populate `user1_*` and `user2_*` environment variables, which subsequent requests can reference using `{{user1_username}}`, `{{user2_username}}`, etc.\n"
      },
